operations across the retail, small and medium enterprise, and commercial sectors. Catcha Digital Berhad was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"Catcha Digital Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于2010年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，通过投资控股、在线媒体及其他三个部门运营，为马来西亚品牌主和广告代理商提供数字媒体广告服务。","lines":["在线媒体与广告：提供在线媒体广告、社交媒体营销、体验式营销、广告、电影、视频和电视节目服务，客户为品牌主和广告代理商。","活动与IT服务：提供展览和活动管理、IT软件解决方案及电影放映活动。","数字媒体与代理：拥有并运营数字媒体出版商、网红营销平台、数字代理i-canvas和数字户外广告。","Nexible：AI驱动的销售自动化平台，帮助房地产行业企业管理线索和客户关系。","ORIGINS：综合贷款解决方案，简化零售、中小企业和商业领域的运营。"],"lines_en":["Online Media & Advertising: Provides online media advertising, social media marketing, experiential marketing, advertising, motion picture, and video and television program services to brand owners and advertising agencies.","Events & IT Services: Offers exhibition and event management, IT software solutions, and motion picture projection activities.","Digital Media & Agency: Owns and operates digital media publishers, an influencer marketing platform, digital agency i-canvas, and digital out-of-home advertising.","Nexible: An AI-powered sales automation platform that enables businesses to manage leads and customer relationships in the real estate sector.","ORIGINS: A comprehensive lending solution that streamlines operations across retail, SME, and commercial sectors."]}}